Third-party material in this repository
---------------------------------------

Each entry says what the files themselves state.

  fe/.claude/skills/angular-developer/
      Guidance files for Angular development. SKILL.md states "license: MIT"
      and "author: Copyright 2026 Google LLC".

  country-kit/example/fe/styles/fonts/lato/
      The Lato font, under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1. Its
      copyright notice and the licence are in OFL.txt beside the font.

  guides/stylesheets/github-light.css
      "Copyright 2014 GitHub Inc.", under the Apache License, Version 2.0
      (its header).

  be/mvnw, be/mvnw.cmd
      The start scripts of the Apache Maven Wrapper, version 3.3.4. Their
      headers read "Licensed to the Apache Software Foundation (ASF) under
      one or more contributor license agreements" and place them under the
      Apache License, Version 2.0.

  fe/shared-map/portrayal/*.svg
      The six map symbols. Their comments name the IHO S-124 symbol each one
      draws or follows. The four with letters (nw-point.svg, nw-tag.svg,
      nm-point.svg, nm-tag.svg) say that the letters are outlines of
      Liberation Sans Bold 2.1.5 (SIL OFL). fe/docs/map-portrayal.md
      describes how the symbols follow the IHO S-124 portrayal catalogue,
      Edition 2.0.0, which is not in this repository.

  be/niord/src/main/resources/aton/INT-1-preset.xml
      The INT-1 seamark preset from
      https://raw.githubusercontent.com/OpenSeaMap/josm/master/INT-1-preset.xml
      (the address is in AtonDefaultsService.java). The file names its
      authors and states no licence.

  be/niord/src/test/resources/OSMSchema.xsd
      Its first line names the original version:
      https://github.com/oschrenk/osm/blob/master/osm-io/src/main/resources/OSMSchema.xsd
      It states no licence.

The libraries that Maven and npm fetch when Niord is built are not in this
repository. Each is under its own licence.
